      "text": "Algebraic index theorem — We prove the Atiyah-Singer index theorem where the algebra of pseudo- differential operators is replaced by an arbitrary deformation quantization of the algebra of functions\n\n**Algebraic index theorem**\n\n*Ryszard Nest*\n\n40 pp, 21 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We prove the Atiyah-Singer index theorem where the algebra of pseudo- differential operators is replaced by an arbitrary deformation quantization of the algebra of functions on a symplectic manifold.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; &(A)-^ CCf; 1 The Algebraic Index Theorem; Tr(/*0)=; 2 Characteristic Map Associated to a Trace; CCm(A)=; CC*(A\\; ΛA,;); C.(gχ4) \"; 11 x[F,a2]...[F,an]e-; 1 In the same fashion we get the morphism 2τ '; C^MCC^A^ft-; 3.2 Local Computation of^2n~\\-; 4 Algebraic Index Theorem for Formal Deformati; 7 An Application; 1 G C°(M, CC0(^A/)); Σ(-\\γtdfr",
